          "value": 75,
          "unit": "mm",
          "kind": "measured",
          "source": "cotswold-vernacular.c04"
        }
      },
      "rule": "Little or no eaves overhang — not more than about 75 mm. The roof edge is closed with stone, not extended in timber (c04, hard).",
      "sources": [
        "cotswold-vernacular.c04"
